la-de-imprensa/companhia/87-dos-clientes-do-nu-relatam-impacto-positivo-em-suas-vidas-indice-chega-a-90-nas-areas-rurais-do-mexico","source":"Nu","limitations":"Customer self-reports are not causal effects, national market share or audited financial outcomes."},{"id":"finance-nu-q2-ai-20260813","date":"2026-08-13","publishedAt":null,"dateBasis":null,"title":"Nu reports wider NuFormer deployment and a Mexican banking launch","summary":"Nu reported 139 million customers and its first quarterly net income above US$1 billion. Its update describes NuFormer in production for Brazilian and Mexican credit cards and Brazilian unsecured lending, with other products still in tests.","implication":"Evaluate a shared financial-behavior model across GoPay credit products only with risk controls and separate product-level validation.","nextAction":"Check model lift at fixed loss, calibration by borrower group, overrides, explainability, privacy and model operating cost.","url":"https://international.nubank.com.br/pt-br/companhia/nu-holdings-ltd-divulga-resultados-financeiros-do-segundo-trimestre-de-2026/","source":"Nu Holdings","limitations":"Company claims do not prove causality or equivalent results for GoTo. Client count is not the same as active borrowers."},{"id":"insight-nu-model-vintage-discipline-20260514","date":"2026-05-14","publishedAt":null,"dateBasis":null,"title":"Nu pairs AI credit deployment with risk-adjusted reporting","summary":"Nu's Q1 release reports NuFormer in credit-card decisioning in Brazil and Mexico and unsecured lending in Brazil. It also reports higher early delinquency and credit-loss allowances, alongside credit expansion.","implication":"Judge a new credit model by risk-adjusted cohort outcomes and governance, rather than model deployment or loan growth alone.","nextAction":"Use out-of-time tests and licensed-partner governance; compare approvals at fixed expected loss, later realized losses, fairness and collections outcomes.","url":"https://nu.com/en/newsroom/company/nu-holdings-ltd-reports-first-quarter-2026-financial-results","source":"Nu Holdings","limitations":"Issuer statements do not isolate AI's causal effect. Product mix, seasonality and borrower selection can explain changes; Brazilian or Mexican results cannot be assumed in Indonesia."},{"id":"global-update-8","date":"2026-05-14","publishedAt":null,"dateBasis":null,"title":"Nu reports foundation models in credit underwriting","summary":"Issuer results describe NuFormer in production for credit cards in Brazil/Mexico and unsecured lending in Brazil.","implication":"Monitor model governance, loss-vintage outcomes and risk-adjusted credit expansion rather than equating AI deployment with better credit performance.","nextAction":null,"url":"https://international.nubank.com.br/en/newsroom/company/nu-holdings-ltd-reports-first-quarter-2026-financial-results","source":"Original source","limitations":"Analyst interpretation; reported capabilities are not independently validated"}]}